Description: 8k intro by joga, released in 2016
 Sevenance is a 64-bit Linux intro by joga, ranked 4th in the PC intro
 competition at Simulaatio 2016. It renders OpenGL 3.3 shards with
 scrolling greetings and synthesized music, using the desktop resolution.
 .
 Mind the volume: the soundtrack is loud.
